WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.853 --> 00:00:07.937
Open "Trade packs" in the project and choose your trade.

2
00:00:08.437 --> 00:00:14.143
Choose what you are doing and adjust layers, coverage or waste.

3
00:00:14.643 --> 00:00:20.350
You see how much you need and what to buy.

4
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:26.564
Tap "Put in the quote": labour and materials become lines.

5
00:00:27.064 --> 00:00:34.693
Share the materials list with your colleague or the shop.

